<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Zul</book>
  <para style="h">Afisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Afi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Afisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tǝlankur kǝ Bulus dǝ mǝn Afisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tǝlankur kǝ Bulus dǝ mǝn kopi kǝ Afisa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">Bulus shirmi mǝn kopi kǝ Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Tǝlankur kǝn ɗǝl ni karǝm ami Bulus, nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu kan Yam zǝzarǝm gwa, kǝ dǝ ri mbarǝm kǝ Yam gip bǝn kǝ Afisa, munju kan bi gam gǝzǝn Almasihu Yesu gwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Naa dǝ zo mbatl na dǝmi zhǝlili kǝ Ba gǝmi Yam na Babom Yesu Almasihu dǝm nan kǝne.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ho bar ju kan Yam bi mi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Dǝ ɗǝɗa Yam Bǝba kǝ Babom gǝmi Yesu Almasihu. Tǝ pi mi albarka na ko gonge albarka kǝ Ruhu sur yam gip ngashi gam gǝmi na Almasihu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kapǝn dǝ Yam pi atl kundǝrǝndlip ni tǝ zǝzar mi gip ngashi gam gǝmi na Almasihu, kǝ dǝ mǝ dǝm dlǝran munju ra na argon mǝgǝni da'a den ger gǝsi. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Gip ndutǝn gǝs ni terka tǝ ne kǝ dǝ mǝ dǝm mimir gǝs tǝp kar Yesu Almasihu. Yam pi ni untu den ar tǝmi tǝni bi tǝ pi untu. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Tǝ pini untu kǝ dǝ mǝ ɗǝɗa nartǝn kǝ zo mbatl gǝsi, muntu kan tǝ bi mi ngǝlǝk tǝp kar nya gǝs muntu tǝ ndu gwa, Yesu ituwi.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Tǝp kǝba mǝshtǝn kǝ Almasihu ni Yam ɗǝli mi kan tǝ ho'i mi warwat pitǝn gǝmika gip ngashi gam gǝmi nan ti. Muntu ni gode mi nartǝn kǝ zo mbatl kǝ Yami. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Tǝ bi mi zo mbatl tu na naari, na bopya, kup na momi bari. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Yam kum tǝmi kǝ ɓuli mi sǝrri kǝ argon tu tǝ pǝn tor gip mbatl kǝ pi tǝp kar Almasihu gwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Argon tu Yam ba ndu piwo ar ni'e, wokoci ni piwo tǝ mee gam bar kup am dǝ Almasihu, bar ju kan ra to yamka, na bar ju kan ra den atl gwa ijuwi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Tǝp kǝ ngashi gam gǝmi na Almasihu ni Yam zǝzar mi kǝ dǝ mǝ dǝm mbarǝm gǝsi, nan tǝ tare tǝ ne wi den untuni baa pi gwa. Tǝ pini bar gǝs kandatu tǝ ne kǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Tǝ pi ni untu kǝ dǝ mǝn kan mǝ pare ngǝshtǝn den Almasihuwo, mǝ pi dǝmi kǝ ɗǝɗa nartǝn gǝsi. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Kǝ kum shirǝm kǝ ge shirǝmi wi. Ge shirǝm tuwo ar ni'e zo shirǝm tu kan ɗǝli in nan kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den Yesu gwa. Gip ngashi gam gin nan tiwo, tǝ bi in Ruhu kǝ Yami. Ruhu tu kan gode'e kǝn gwas ni gwa itu. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Ruhu kǝ Yam ni ba tabbate mi'e Yam baa bi mi argon tu tǝ wule tii bi mi gwa. Mii zam ni muntu gas tu Yam baa ɗǝli munju kan gwas ni gwa. Muntu ngapo den bi ɗǝɗa nartǝn gǝs ni.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm na Yam kǝ Bulus dǝ mǝn Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Den untuwo, a goode Yam tun kan a kum gǝs kǝ ngǝshtǝn gin den Babom Yesu, na ndutǝn tu kǝ pi mbarǝm kǝ Yam gwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />A za goode Yam den kǝn da'a. A laa kǝn gip shirǝm gǝn na Yami. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />A liri'e dǝ Yam muntu kan ti ni'e bǝba mǝn nartǝn kǝ babom gǝmi Yesu Almasihu kem dǝ Ruhu gǝs bi in bopya, kan dǝ Ruhu gǝs ɓuli in kǝ dǝ kǝ mom Yam hoyi. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />A lir Yam es kǝ dǝ kǝ mom ge shirǝmi, dǝ kǝ mom ni la'i mbatl tu tǝ lakǝn bi dene gwa. Kǝdǝ kǝ pa mom ni nartǝn kǝ albarka tu kan ti pi mbarǝm gǝs gwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />A pa lir Yam dǝ tǝ bi in momi nartǝn kǝ iko gǝs tu kan ba mani ngashi na argon dagwa, ar ni'e iko tu kan ba ne mi am ra mǝn kan mǝ ngǝsh den Almasihu gwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />Yam gode ni iko mǝn ndǝrtǝn tu nan tǝ tli Almasihu gip gambǝci'e, kan tǝ ne ti den am shimli gǝs to yam ka gwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />To yami kani tǝ dǝm sur gami na ko gonge mulki, na iko, na ndǝrtǝni, na ga babomi, na kup kiri sun ju ba bi gwa, ba'e gip zhan kǝn ni katl da'a ama ar ri patǝn kǝ bari. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Yam ne ko unu atli dǝ iko kǝ Almasihu, tǝ pa ne ti den gam kǝ ko unu kǝ dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi zam ci cina ra. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi ni'e dli kǝ Almasihu, gip domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi ni ba shin pitǝn kǝ Almasihu kup, ti kan na iko den ko unu na ko ako gwa.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Dǝmi na ge mbatl gip ngashi gam na Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Faro kǝn ni wule mǝshi mbarǝme, domici kǝ nge kopi Yamka kǝn den pi warwat pitǝne. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Faro kǝn nǝra den dǝmi gip pi warwat pitǝne, wule nami mbarǝm kan mom Yam da gwa, kǝn den kopi gun dun itǝri. Ti ni'e ruhu tu kan ba co mbarǝm kǝ nge kopi Yam gwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Kup gǝmi faro mǝn ni den pi warwat pitǝne, mǝ ne den kopi argon tu dli gǝmi ba ndu gwa na kopi ndu'i kǝ mbatl na damtǝn gǝsi. Den dǝmi kǝ warwat pitǝn tawo, mǝ ndari dǝ lo kǝ Yam sur den mi wule nami mbarǝme.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ama Yamo laa'i ni tǝra na guna gere, ndutǝn tu tǝ ndu mi na riwo ar naari. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Ar ni kem nan mǝn ra mǝshi far gip nge kopi Yamo, Yam kem mǝ dǝm mǝn ge mbatl na Almasihuwi. Yam ɗǝli in ni tǝp kǝ ba zo mbatl gǝsi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Yam tli mini gip mǝshtǝni kandatu tǝ tli Almasihu gip gambǝci gwa, kan tǝ bi mi ba dǝmi na Almasihu Yesu to yam ka. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Yam pini untu kǝ dǝ gip zhan mǝn ɗirtǝno tǝ gode mbarǝm zo mbatl gǝs mǝn nartǝni, kan ba mani ngashi na argon dagwa. Zo mbatl tu kan tǝ gode mi tǝp kǝ ba ngashi gam gǝmi na Almasihu Yesu gwa.<verse eid="EPH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Yam ɗǝli in ni tǝp kǝ ba zo mbatl gǝsi, domici kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den Almasihu wi. Ba'e destǝn kǝ gam gin ni da'a, ama bi bar kǝ Yam ni. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Ba'e ɓatltǝn kǝ pi mbap gon ni da'a, bǝse dǝ murgon ɓo ngetl ra. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Yam ni pali mi kandatu mǝnra kǝkǝn gwa, tǝ pali mini peli gip ngashi gam gǝmi na Almasihu Yesu. Yam pini untu kǝ dǝ mǝ pi mbuni bar ju kan tǝ ne terka kǝ dǝ mǝ pi gwa.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn Yahuda na nami mbarǝm dǝm nǝm wi gip Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Ra untuwo, dam kǝn ni den kandatu kǝn ra far gwa, kǝn mǝn Yahuda ni da'a tǝp kǝ ba gǝri. Mǝn Yahuda ba lakǝn ni bi'e &lt;&lt;Nduɓuli.&gt;&gt; Artu sǝrtǝn tu ba piwo gip dli ni na am kǝ mbarǝme. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Dam kǝn ni den'e wokoci tawo, kǝn ni den dǝmi am luluri na Almasihu. Kǝn mǝn diki ni, bare kar mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila, kǝn ni ra gip gudlum shirǝm tu kan Yam pi gwa da'a. Kǝn ni ra den kaar atl bat na la'i mbatli, ngapo kǝ mom Yam da'a.<verse eid="EPH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ama kǝkǝn gip me gam gin na Almasihu Yesuwo, kǝn kan ra far dlyami na Yamo, ɗir kǝn wi kosak nan ti tǝp kar bǝran tu kan Almasihu shoti wokoci tu tǝ mǝsh gwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Almasihu na gam gǝs ni ɗiri mi dǝmi zhǝlili. Ti ni tǝ ngashi gam mǝn Yahuda na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a wu dǝm mbarǝm nǝm. Tǝ yas pan kǝ ngetǝn tu kan ra gip dlom gǝmi gwawi. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Tǝp kǝ ba bi dli gǝs ni tǝ pali Kulci kǝ mǝn Yahuda na bar ju ar yari gwa ina iko da'a. Na untuni tǝ ɗiri dǝmi zhǝlili gip dlom kǝ mǝn Yahuda na munju mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. Kan tǝ pali wur gǝsgal nǝm den am kǝ gǝsgal rop ju. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Tǝp kǝ ba mǝshtǝn kǝ Almasihu den kin tu ni ɗiri dǝmi zhǝlili gip dlom kǝ mǝn Yahuda na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. Tǝp untu ni tǝ pa ɗiri dǝmi zhǝlili gip dlom gǝmi na Yami. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Almasihu pi in wazu kǝ dǝmi zhǝlili kǝn kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a, kan ra far dlyami na Yami, nan mi mǝn Yahuda kan ra kosak nan ti gwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Tǝp kǝ ba argon tu Almasihu piyi gwa arni kup gǝmi ropi bi mi dama kǝ ɗirtǝn kar Bǝba tǝp kǝ ba Ruhu nǝm.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Kǝkǝno, kǝn kan mǝn Yahuda ni dawo, kǝ'i mǝndiki ko bare da'a. Ama kǝ dǝm nǝm na mbarǝm kǝ Yami, mir mǝn bom kǝ Yami. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Kup gino wule bin ni kǝn ra kan tu den kulci kǝ mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu na mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa, Almasihu Yesu na gam gǝs ngapo ti ni'e bar ndǝri tat gǝs bini. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Ti ni giɓǝrtǝn kǝ bini kup ra den ti, ti ni tǝ kem bi ni ar pi ta nartǝni ar dǝm las ni dlǝran kan ne Babom gwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Tǝp kǝ ba ngashi gam gin na Almasihu ni kǝn kan mǝn Yahuda ni da ma kǝ dǝm bin kan tu gwawi nǝm na nami mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yam wi, kǝ dǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam dǝm gip kǝne.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Bulus pi wazu munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Den untu ni ami Bulus la'ǝm gip bom kǝ moni den'e ami kǝ Almasihu Yesu ni, kan eso a pi in wazu kǝn kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Na ho bi a mom'e kǝ kum shirǝm kǝ mbap tu kan Yam bim tǝp kǝ ba zo mbatl gǝs den bi gin gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Yam kem a mom sǝrri kǝ argon tu tǝ ndu pi, kandatu a rǝsh njem dene gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Kǝnni kǝ zhit tǝlankuriwo, kii mani momi bar ju a mom den sǝrri kǝ Almasihu gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Terkawo mbarǝm mani momi sǝrri tu da'a, kandatu kan kǝkǝno Ruhu kǝ Yam ɓuli mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu na ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kan bi gam gǝzǝn gip bote ti gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Sǝrriyi ni'e tǝp kǝ ba zo shirǝm ni munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a dǝm mǝn zami gado nǝm na mǝn Yahuda wi. Mǝ dǝm wule njwal nǝm gip dli nǝm wi. Wu ma wii mani zami argon tu Yam wule ti bi mi tǝp kar Almasihu Yesu gwa.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />A dǝm ni nye mǝn yari zo shirǝm tu kan bim gip zo mbatl kǝ Yam tǝp kar pi mbap kǝ iko gǝsi. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Kup na ami ra atli na munju kan heli ni gip mbarǝm kǝ Yamo, bim ni dama kǝ yari zo shirǝm kǝn dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a, den bar nartǝn kǝ Almasihu muntu kan baa mani bori gǝsi dagwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Yam zǝzarǝm ni kǝ dǝ a yari mbarǝm argon tu ra gip sǝrri tu gwa tetla-tetla, sǝrri tu kan terka ra na ghuuni kar Yam muntu kan pi bar kup gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Yam pini untu den kǝkǝno tǝp kar mǝn kopiwo tǝ gode womti bopya gǝs dǝ mǝn mulki, na munju ra na iko to yam ka gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Muntu pini den argon tu kan Yam bari kǝ pi terka. Tǝ pa'i ni pi untuyi tǝp kar Almasihu Yesu Babom gǝmi. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Domici kǝ ngashi gam gǝmi na Almasihu na tǝp kar ngǝshtǝn den ti, muntu ni kem mǝn ra na ɓa'i bigul kǝ ɗirtǝn cina dǝ Yami. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Ra untuwo, a lir kǝn den ba kǝ dǝm ni na ceni mbatl da'a domici kǝ kumi dli gǝn den bi gini. Muntu ba dǝmi in bar kǝ ɓe ngetle.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm na Yam den bi kǝ mǝn Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Den untuni a kur ngus cina dǝ Bǝba, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />muntu kan mǝn mir mǝn bom gǝs ni, munju kup kan ra to yamka na munju kan ra den kaar atl gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Shirǝm na Yam gǝn ni'e dǝ gip bar nartǝn gǝso, tǝ ndǝri in bigule, na tǝ bi in mani pi bar tǝp kar Ruhu gǝs gip mbatl gini. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />A shirǝm na Yam kǝ dǝ tǝp kar ngǝshtǝn den Almasihu gino, tǝ dǝm gip mbatl gini. A shirǝm na Yam den kǝ ɓa ni gip ndutǝne kan dǝ ndutǝn zam dǝmi gip mbatl gini. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Ndutǝn tu ni baa kem kǝn na mbarǝm kǝ Yam kup mani momi kandatu ngǝlantǝn, na tlyartǝni, na totǝn den yami, na dlyamtǝn su atl ka kǝ ndutǝn kǝ Almasihu ra gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Kǝ pa mom ndutǝn kǝ Almasihu tu kan tla gam kǝ momi bari. A pa shirǝm na Yam kǝ dǝ laa'i in den bi laa'itǝn kǝ Yam kup.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Ɗǝɗatǝn kupo kǝ Yam gǝmi ni. Tǝp kǝ ba iko gǝs kan den mbap gip mi gwa ni tǝ pi bar ar man kandatu mǝ liri ko mǝ dami gwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Naa dǝ ɗǝɗatǝn kǝ Yam dǝm gip mǝn kopi, na gip Almasihu Yesu, ar kop zhan kup, ar ri patǝn kǝ bari! Ar dǝm untu.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Dǝmi nǝm gip dli kǝ Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Ra untuwo, ami kan ra gip bom kǝ moni domici kǝ Almasihu, a lir kǝne, kǝn kan Yam zǝzar kǝn kǝ dǝm mbarǝm gǝs gwa, dǝ kǝ pi ni dǝmi tu kan baa gholi Yam mbatl gwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ko gigasi pali ni gam gin atli, na dǝmi na ghalǝm mbatli, dǝm ni na te mbatl kaar ka, na mani dǝmi na ya'ǝn gip ndutǝne. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Pi ni kup argon tu kii mani pi kǝ gaa ni me gam tu kan Ruhu bi in gwa. Pi ni untu gip dǝmi zhǝlili tu kan ngashi in gam gwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kup gino dli nǝm ni, Ruhu nǝm ni es ba kop nan kǝne. Kǝn ra na la'i mbatl nǝm kan lakǝn bi dene gwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Babom gino nǝm ni, ngǝshtǝn den Yam gin nǝm ni, batisma nǝm ni pi ine. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Yamo nǝm ni, ti ni'e Ba kǝ mbarǝm kup. Ti ni'e muntu kan den gam kǝ bar kup, tǝ pi mbap tǝp kar ko unu, kan tǝ den dǝmi gip ko unu.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Almasihu bi ko gonge gǝmi zo bari. Tǝ bi ni na ɓuli ame. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Kandatu ar ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt;Nan tǝ to gǝs yamo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">tǝ ndara na mbarǝm ju tǝ nǝm wur gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">kan tǝ bi mbarǝm bi bar kǝ Ruhu.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zab. 68.18</char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Ununu,&lt;&lt;Tǝ to yami.&gt;&gt;Ba pi nupi im ba'e faro tǝ sur ni gǝsi na atl da gwawu? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Ti muntu sur atl tu ni'e nǝm muntu to yami gami dǝ ko gonge yami, kǝ dǝ iko gǝs nǝra gip atl kundǝrǝndlip. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Almasihu yi ni bi jen mbap kǝ dǝmi mir mǝn kartǝne, jeno mbap kǝ yari shirǝm kǝ Yami, jeno mbap kǝ yari zo shirǝm kǝ Almasihu, kan jen ngapo mbap kǝ ne ger den mbarǝm kǝ Yami, na mǝn kulci mbarǝme. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Mbap gǝzǝn ni'e wu kǝrkǝm mbarǝm kǝ Yam kǝ pi mbapi, kǝ dǝ wu tu dli kǝ Almasihu ra. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Mbapi baa ci cina se kup gǝmi ni mo gam gip ngǝshtǝn na momi Nya Yami. Na untu ni mi ndǝr gip ngǝshtǝn den Yami, ar ri mi gip dǝmi kandatu Almasihu ragwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ra untuwo mi'i dǝm na holi damtǝn den bar wule mimir da'a. Ba'i bali mi ɗe na barta na ko gonge itǝr kǝ pel kulci bar da'a. Mi'i kop kǝ mbarǝm munju ba ndu jili gǝmi ka na lar munju ba ni wule ge shirǝm ni gwa da'a. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ama mi yari ge shirǝmi gip ndutǝne, mǝn den nartǝn gip ko unu wule Almasihu, muntu ti ni'e gam kǝ dliyi gwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Tǝp kar ti ni dliyi kup mo gam dlakǝt. Kandatu ko gonge jwal ba pi zo mbap gǝs gwa, ar ba ne am jwali jen wu naari, kǝ dǝ dliyi kup nǝra gingǝlǝn den nartǝn na ndǝrtǝn gip ndutǝne.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pel dǝmi gip Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Kǝkǝno a ndu a yari in argon gip Babom den ba kǝ dǝm ni kandatu munju kan mom Yam da'a ba pi gwa, na jiltǝnka gip damtǝn kǝ mbatl gǝzǝni. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Mbatl gǝzǝn nǝra laa'i na dǝmǝni, kan wi nǝra am luluri na ge mbatl tu kan Yam ba bi gwa domici kǝ dǝmǝn gam gǝzǝni, na lati mbatl gǝzǝni. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Nan mbatl gǝzǝn konkawo wu'i na sham da'a, ar ni wu bi gam gǝzǝn gip holi dǝmi dlǝran na ci cina gip pi ko unu bar kǝ dǝɗanye.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Ama kǝno, untuni kǝ kulci den pitǝn kǝ Almasihu da'a. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Kǝ kum den tiwi, kǝn mǝn kopi gǝso pa kulci in den kandatu ge shirǝmi ra gip Yesu gwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Kulci in ni den kandatu dǝmi gin ra far gwa, den kǝ byal ni kor pitǝn ginka, muntu kan likawi na lam setǝn gǝsi. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Pa kulci in den kǝ kǝrkǝm ni damtǝn kǝ mbatl gin ar mbuni. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Yam pali mi ni den kandatu tǝra gwa. Pel pitǝn tu ngapo ba mani ni shini tǝp kǝ ba pitǝn dlat na dǝmi dlǝran.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Ra untuwo za ni ceni lare, dǝ ko gonge mbarǝm yari berǝm dǝmi gǝs ge shirǝmi, domici kup gǝmi jwal kǝ dli nǝm ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />&lt;&lt;Gip pi lo gino ba kǝ pini warwat pitǝn da'a.&gt;&gt; Ba kǝ za ni dǝ pǝt nda bin kǝ'i den lo da'a, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />domici lo ba bi ni gun dun itǝr tǝpe. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Naa dǝ muntu kan murno tǝ za pi mure. Naa tǝ pi mbapi, tǝ pi mbap hoyi na am gǝsi, kǝ dǝ tǝ zami, tǝ pa bi munju am ri wur kaar da gwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Ba kǝ zani dǝ mǝgǝn shirǝm gon ɗǝl ter bi da'in da'a. Naa dǝ bar ju kup ki yariwo ar dǝm kǝ ne am ya'ǝn ra den bi argon tu wu ndu gwa. Tǝp untu ni shirǝm gin baa ɓa'i bigul munju kum shirǝmi gwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Ba kǝ li ni Ruhu kǝ Yam mbatl da'a. Tune ni'e tiwo wule ɓe am ni kan ba sede'e kǝn kǝ Yam ni gwa gas patǝn kǝ bari. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Za ni ko gonge ɗasi mbatli, guzǝl pitǝn kǝ mbatli, lo'e, dlanye, ne shirǝm mbarǝm gam, na ko gonge mǝgǝn pitǝne. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Dǝm ni na ho pitǝn na kumi guna den ya'ǝni, gafarteni ya'ǝnka, kandatu Yam gafarte inka tǝp kar Almasihu gwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Ra untuwo, dǝm ni mǝn pi bar ju Yam ba pi gwa, den dǝmi gin mimir gǝs kǝ ndu'i. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Pi ni dǝmi kǝ ndutǝne, kandatu Almasihu ba ndu mi gwa. Tǝ ndu mi kan tǝ bi gam gǝs bar mǝn tǝmi kasǝr kan ta'i Yam gwa.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dǝm ni gip cirtǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Ba dǝ kum shirǝm kǝ muri na mǝtli na moni kari gip kǝn da'a, na ko gonge pitǝn kǝ holi dǝmi dlǝran, ko ndu'i gam gip zami ra. Munju ndari na mbarǝm kǝ Yam da'a. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Ba dǝ zam usun shirǝm, na shirǝm mburtǝne, na mǝgǝn shirǝm gip cet gi ni, domici ar ndari da'a, ama den bi untuwo dǝm ni mǝn goode Yami. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Mom ni'e mǝn muri na mǝtli ko moni kari, ko mǝn holi dǝmi dlǝran, ko mǝn ndu'i gam gip zami ra (muntu kan nǝm ni tǝra na mǝn bote mir yam jeni) baa zam gaado gip mulki kǝ Almasihu na kǝ Yam da'a. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Ba dǝ murgon jili in nǝka na kǝdlǝm shirǝm da'a, domici den warwat pitǝn ju ni lo kǝ Yam ba nde gam munju ba nge kopi shirǝm gǝs gwa.<verse eid="EPH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ra untuwo ba kǝ me ni gam nan wur gip warwat pitǝn ju wu pi gwa da'a. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Faro gam gin nǝra gip dǝmǝni, ama kǝkǝno kǝ zam cirtǝn wi tǝp kar Babomi. Ra untuwo dǝm ni wule mbarǝm kǝ cirtǝni! <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Domici cirtǝn tu kan gip kǝno ba gǝri ni argon tu kan mbuni ni, na argon tu kan dlat ni, na pi bar gip ho mbatli. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Ngen ni argon tu baa gholi Babom mbatl gwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Zaa ni pi warwat pitǝn ju mbarǝm ba pi gip dǝmǝn gwa, ama ɗǝli ni bar ju ba pi gwa kǝba cirtǝni. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Bar kǝ sham ni dǝ shirǝm den bar ju mǝn nge kopi shirǝm kǝ Yam ba pi gip dǝmǝn gwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Ama in ɗiri ko unu kǝ ba cirtǝno, ar ni ba shin kandatu wura gwa hoyi. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Cirtǝn ba kem ni dǝ shin ko unu. Ar ni kem ba wule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Ki mǝn nde umuri, putu'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">tlyam gip mǝshtǝn gi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Almasihu ba bi'i cirtǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Ra untuwo ngup kǝn ni den kandatu kǝ dǝm gwa. Ba kǝ dǝmni wule kǝdlǝm da'a, ama wule mǝn bopya. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Pi ni ho mbap na wokoci tu kǝ zam gwa, domici wokoci jin ni mbarǝm ra laa'i na wani pitǝne. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ra untuwo ba kǝ dǝm ni kǝdlǝmi da'a, ama mom ni argon tu baa gholi Babom mbatl gwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ba kǝ tla ni argon tu kup baa tlo kǝn gwa da'a. Muntu baa kem kǝn kǝ dǝmi kǝdlǝmi. Ama za ni dǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam kop nan kǝne. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Shirǝm ni na ya'ǝn na shirǝm kǝ gip Zabura, na kon ɗǝɗa Yami, na kon mǝn ruhu. Pi ni ta ɗǝɗa Babom gip mbatl gini. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Ko gigasi goode ni Yam Bǝbayi den bar kup gip sun kǝ Babom gǝmi Yesu Almasihu. <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Bi ni gam gin gip kopi shirǝm kǝ ya'ǝn na mbatl nǝm gip shini nartǝn kǝ Almasihu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝtli kushi na moni gǝzǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Mǝtli kushi, wule kandatu kǝ bi gam gin gip kopi shirǝm kǝ Babom Yesu na mbatl nǝmo, untu ni pa kii bi gam gin gip kopi shirǝm kǝ moni gin na mbatl nǝm. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Domici kos ni gami dǝ gǝr gǝsi kandatu kan Almasihu ni'e gam kǝ mǝn kopi gwa. Wi ni wule dli gǝsi kan ti ni'e mǝn ɗǝli gǝzǝni. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Kandatu mǝn kopi ba ngusi gam Almasihuwo, untuni mǝtli kushi ba ngusi gam moni gǝzǝn gip bar kup pa'e.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Moni, ndu ni mǝtli gini, kandatu Almasihu ba ndu mǝn kopi kan tǝ bi gam gǝs den bi gǝzǝn gwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Almasihu pi ni untu kǝ tǝ ne ti ka markǝmi dlǝran, tǝ sar tǝka, tǝp kǝ ba ho'i gǝs na mal gip shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Almasihu pii ni untu kǝ dǝ tǝ ɗiri gam gǝs mǝn kopi gip ɗǝɗatǝn naari. Wu nǝra na argon mǝgǝni, ko wantǝn, ko warwat bar gon es da'a. Ama wi nǝra dlǝran na argon mǝgǝni da'a den ger gǝsi. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Untuni esi, ar nǝm dǝ moni ndu mǝtli gǝzǝn kandatu wu ndu dli gǝzǝn gwa. Muntu ba ndu gǝr gǝso gam gǝs ni tǝ ndu'i. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Murgon ra kan taɓe nge dli gǝs gwa da'a, ama tǝ gaa ni dli gǝs kandatu Almasihu ba ndu mǝn kopi gwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Ko gonge gip miwo kǝti ni den dli kǝ Almasihu. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Kandatu ar ra na rǝshi gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm baa za bas na naska kan wu ngash gam na gǝr gǝsi. Ropiwo wi dǝm dli nǝm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Muntuwo bar shirǝm tu kan na ghuuni gwa ni, ama ami ni den shirǝm den Almasihu na mǝn kopi kup. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Untu ni es a yari, ar nǝm kos te yarka tǝ ndu gǝr gǝsi kandatu tǝ ndu gam gǝs gwa. Gǝri ngapo ar nǝm ti te yarka tǝ ngusi gam bakos gǝsi.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Mimir na mǝn gǝri gǝzǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Kǝn mimiri, tun kan kǝn kǝ Babom Yesuno, kop ni shirǝm kǝ mǝn gǝri gini, muntuwo kor ni ar ra. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Muntu ni'e doka kǝ pari kan ra na gudlum shirǝm gwa'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 6:2">&lt;&lt;Kǝ ngusi gam bǝba na nǝna gi,<verse eid="EPH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />kǝ dǝ bar mbuni'i ra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 6:3">kan dǝ muri dlyami'i den kaar atli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Ga bǝba, ba kǝ pini argon tu baa kem mimir gin kǝ la'i gam dǝ rai ka da'a. Argon tu kii piwo ar ni'e, gaa wur ni, ne wur ni den ho tǝpe, kan kǝ kulci wur ni na kulcitǝn kǝ Babomi.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ga zher na Babom gǝzǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Kǝn zhere, kop ni shirǝm kǝ ga babom gin kan den kaar atl gwa na mbatl nǝm. Ngusi wur ni gam na mbatl nǝm, wule Almasihu ni kǝ pi ti. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Kop ni shirǝm kǝ ga babom gin ko gigasi ba'e se wini den shini gin, kǝ shini kǝ ger katl da'a, ama wule zher kǝ Almasihu, pi ni argon tu Yam ba ndu gwa na mbatl nǝm. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Bote wur ni na mbatl nǝm wule Babom ni kǝ bote ti, ba'e mbarǝm da'a. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Kǝ mom'e Babom baa ɓatl ko gonge mbarǝm den kup mbuni bar tu tǝ pi gwa, ko ti zher ni ko tǝ nya mǝn bom ni.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Kǝn ga Babomo, pii ni ga zher gin untu. Ba kǝ la wur ni gip bǝrti da'a, mom ni'e Babom gǝzǝn kup na gegino nǝm ni, ti ni to yam ka. Tǝ ngapo tǝ ndu murgon man gon da'a.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bar kǝ dlan ju Yam ba bi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Kǝ pa'i bisiwo, ndǝrni gip ngashi gam gin na Babomi. Naa kǝ zam ni ndǝrtǝn tǝp kǝ ba iko gǝs mǝn nartǝni. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Yem ni kup bar kǝ dlan ju kan Yam ba bi gwa, kǝ dǝ kǝ mani dlǝri na ndǝrtǝni kan kii mani tare gam gin bi dǝ tǝp ju kup kan gun dun itǝr ba nǝm mbarǝm nari gwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Domici destǝn gǝmiwo na mbarǝm ni da'a, ama gapa ni na mǝn mulki, gapa na mǝn iko, gapa na kiri mani pi bar gip atl kǝ dǝmǝni, kan na gapa na dun itǝr kǝ to dlom yamka. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ra untuwo, yem ni kup bar kǝ dlan kǝ Yami, kǝ dǝ pǝti ni ɗiro, kǝ mani ni dlǝri ra. Kǝn ni kǝ pa'i dlanyiwo, kǝ sa ni ra dlor gip gapa nan wuri. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Dlǝr ni na ndǝrtǝni, dǝ ge shirǝm dǝmi in bar kǝ ɓali gǝs mor gini, dǝ pitǝn dlat dǝmi in bar kǝ ghumi ngetle. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Naa dǝ dǝmi kǝ ritǝn kǝ yari zo shirǝm kǝ dǝmi zhǝlili dǝmi in kaptǝlan te asǝm da'in ka. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Mbǝli den munju kupo, dǝ ngǝshtǝn den Yam dǝmi in bar kǝ dlǝri ge pǝs kǝ gun dun itǝri. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Naa dǝ zami ɗǝltǝn dǝmi in posh gam gǝlla to gam gin ka, shirǝm kǝ Yam ngapo ar dǝmi in bar sǝɓǝr kǝ Ruhu am da'ine. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Shirǝm ni na Yam tǝp kar iko kǝ Ruhu ko gigasi, kǝ kǝrceni gip shirǝm na Yam na ko unu lirtǝne. Dǝm ni gǝɗǝn, kǝrceni gip shirǝm na Yam den am kǝ mbarǝm kǝ Yami.<verse eid="EPH 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Shirǝm ni na Yam den am gǝn pa'e, kǝ dǝ kup wokoci tu a ɓul biwo, dǝ bim mani shirǝm nan aa mani yari sǝrri kǝ zo shirǝmi bat na bǝrti gwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Ami ra na ɓali domici a yari zo shirǝm kǝ Yami. Shirǝm ni na Yam kǝ dǝ a yari bat na bǝrti, a yari kandatu ar ra gwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm kǝ pali bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tikikus, erǝm gǝmi kǝ ndu'i muntu kan bi gam gǝs Babomi gwa, baa yari in bar kup, kǝ dǝ kǝn ma kǝ mom kandatu amira, na argon tu ami den pi gwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Den untuni a kar ti kar kǝne, kǝ dǝ kǝ mom ni kandatu mǝn ra gwa, kan tǝ ɓa'i in bigul ra.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Naa dǝ Ba gǝmi Yam na Babom Yesu Almasihu bi in dǝmi zhǝlili, na ndutǝne, na ngǝshtǝn den Yami. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Dǝ zo mbatl kǝ Yam na ndutǝn tu kan baa pa dagwa kop kup munju ba ndu Babom Yesu Almasihu gwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>